OL,3,AHaitian PM praises El Salvador after
OL,4,Ajoint strike on alleged home of gang
OL,5,Aleader
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaiti's Prime Minister Alix Didier
OL,8,FFils-Aime has praised "the commitment
OL,9,Fof the Salvadorean forces in the fight
OL,10,Fagainst gangs" after a joint strike on
OL,11,Fa house allegedly used by the leader of
OL,12,Fthe 400 Mawozo gang.
OL,14,FEl Salvador's President, Nayib Bukele,
OL,15,Fhad earlier announced that a joint task
OL,16,Fforce had "destroyed" what he described
OL,17,Fas "the house of Lanmo San Jou and the
OL,18,F400 Mawozo gang's headquarters".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
