OL,3,AHaitian PM praises El Salvador after
OL,4,Ajoint strike on alleged home of gang
OL,5,Aleader
OL,6,
OL,7,FA small contingent of Salvadorean
OL,8,Ftroops has been in Haiti since January
OL,9,F2025 as part of a multinational force
OL,10,Fdeployed to suppress gang violence.
OL,12,FLast month, Bukele sent an extra 2,000
OL,13,Fsoldiers to rescue four Salvadoreans
OL,14,Fwho have been missing since they were
OL,15,Fambushed on 18 October.
